                  "title": "Approval Matrix",
                  "section": "2",
                  "section_heading": "Time Off",
                  "text": "Request | Approver\nPTO up to 10 consecutive days | Manager\nPTO over 10 consecutive days | Director\nField-role PTO in the December blackout | Director\nFloating holiday | Manager\nSick time | None (notify your manager)\nParental, bereavement, jury duty | HR (manager notified)\nUnpaid personal leave | HR\nThe rules behind these rows are in the Paid Time Off Policy (RSE-PTO-01), the Holiday Calendar & Observance policy (RSE-HOL-01) and the Leave of Absence Policy (RSE-LV-01). For example, a PTO request of 11 consecutive working days needs the director, while a request of 10 or fewer needs only the manager.",
